From: Eglantine PS5 crash investigation
Subject: [PATCH] Bound GPU memory traversal and skip invalid write side effects

Treat nonempty invalid or wrapping GPU ranges as unmapped before touching page
tables. Preserve empty walker requests as no-ops. Reject invalid writes before
sparse backing and invalidation accumulation, including bulk cached word writes.

